<title>USA: Saliva Diagnostic names new president.</title>
<headline>Saliva Diagnostic names new president.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, Wash. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saliva Diagnostic Systems Inc said Wednesday it has appointed Kenneth McLachlan as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>McLachlan has been chief financial officer since May. The company said in a statement that Ronald Lealos has resigned as president of the company, effective immediately, to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Saliva Diagnostic Systems develops and manufactures non-laboratory medical tests for HIV and other diseases.</p>
